@startuml
title Figure 9a — Authentication and grounding failure
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 48

actor Operator
participant "React UI" as UI
participant "Spring Security +\nAnalysis HTTP adapter" as Boundary
participant "OperatorContextPort" as OperatorContext
participant "Analysis\napplication" as Analysis
participant "PolicyKnowledgePort" as Policy

Operator -> UI : protected analysis action
UI -> Boundary : POST analysis + CSRF
alt unauthenticated
  Boundary --> UI : HTTP 401
  UI --> Operator : authentication required
else authenticated
  Boundary -> OperatorContext : requireAuthenticated()
  OperatorContext --> Boundary : OperatorId
  Boundary -> Analysis : analyze(customerId, OperatorId)
  Analysis -> Policy : retrieveRelevant(context)
  alt no relevant evidence
    Policy --> Analysis : explicit no-evidence
    Analysis --> Boundary : insufficient grounding
    Boundary --> UI : not grounded / not completed
    UI --> Operator : insufficient grounding
  else evidence available
    Policy --> Analysis : PolicyEvidence[] with provenance
  end
end

note right of OperatorContext
  Spring Security Authentication/SecurityContext remain adapter-local.
  The application boundary sees only project-owned OperatorContext/OperatorId.
end note

note right of Analysis
  AC-RAG-002 forbids fabricated grounding provenance.
  Missing evidence cannot fall through into a completed grounded analysis.
end note
@enduml
